  "title": "Pan-Fried Salmon with Cream-Dill Sauce",
  "description": "Salmon tastes great pan-fried and, combined with this delicious creamy sauce with mustard and dill, it turns into a gourmet meal that&#39;s ready in 20 minutes.",
